WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Standing heavy punch starts with Ryu already in the corner.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.000
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu in the air.

4
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.700
A delayed, short-held air light Flash Knuckle continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.550
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the corner conversion.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.650
Luke lands as Ryu finishes the knockdown.
